  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing — `IE2ETrapVerifier` + `IE2EInvariantVerifier` seams already exist; `E2EAcceptanceModule` registration surface already exists; task 170's `PackagedScriptTenantLiteralInvariantVerifier` establishes the pattern. Extension — this task INSTANTIATES 10 real probes against the existing seam, replacing 10 placeholders. Not new components in the §11 sense; new instances of an established pattern. Cost-of-doing-nothing — H13 acceptance gate returns InfraFault for 10 of 11 checks → aggregation never Pass → SetupStatus never Ready → task 186 E2E fails → project's FR-18/SC#5 stated goal (E2E customer provisioning demonstration) remains undemonstrated. THIS IS the load-bearing task that unblocks the terminal acceptance ceremony.

**Splitting note**: if 204c splits into 204c-1..204c-10, this POML becomes the orchestration record with `<sub-tasks>` element listing the 10 standalone POMLs. Task 186's dependency updates accordingly.</notes>

